# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AlphaEngine
#
# Every pattern here is ANCHORED (leading `/`) or extension-scoped, on purpose.
# A bare directory name like `lib/` or `build/` matches at ANY depth, so pasting
# in a language template silently swallowed `web/lib/` — new source files there
# were skipped by `git add -A` without a word and the deployment failed with
# "Module not found: Can't resolve '@/lib/livebook'".
#
# Keep patterns anchored so one language's build-output rule cannot reach into
# another's source tree. `tools/check_repo_complete.sh` guards this.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── secrets — never commit ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── OS / editor ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# ── Python (scoped to the gateway) ───────────────────────────────────────────
/Part2_Infrastructure/venv/
/Part2_Infrastructure/.venv/
/Part2_Infrastructure/build/
/Part2_Infrastructure/dist/
/Part2_Infrastructure/.eggs/
/Part2_Infrastructure/.tox/
/Part2_Infrastructure/htmlcov/
/Part2_Infrastructure/.coverage
*.egg-info/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ── Runtime data (recreated on startup) ──────────────────────────────────────
/Part2_Infrastructure/data/*
!/Part2_Infrastructure/data/.gitkeep
*.duckdb
*.duckdb.wal
*.sqlite

# ── Node / Next.js (scoped to the portal) ────────────────────────────────────
/web/node_modules/
/web/.next/
/web/out/
/web/.vercel/
/web/next-env.d.ts
/web/*.tsbuildinfo
/web/.turbo/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
